div>Sure! I've posted most of my work on exalted on this thread :<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps\"> Maps and cake! (but mostly maps) - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> I like maps. It isn't a secret for anyone here that I love maps, and like making and perusing them. Before the forum change, I had opened up a thread where people would ask me to make maps for their games, and I'd try do do something nice for them. After that, my computer crashed and burned, and I had a </div> </div> </div><br /> and what else there is to see you'll find on my deviantart profile : <br /> <a href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/tipexleloup\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.deviantart.com/tipexleloup</a><br /> <br /> The reason I haven't posted so much in the past months is twofold : I've been prepping maps for my current campaign, that I'll post there in time, but also I've been working on a professional mapmaking project that I can't talk much about for now. It's not related to Exalted, but it's really cool nonetheless.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-14T23:45:36-07:00","id":1374886,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mnemon Liranan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1373576-jen-do-map-for-food-and-hot-gay-bear?p=1374528#post1374528\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can i just say: really awesome maps in your first post! I love your style. Very colorful <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Do you only do Exalted maps? Or can one also ask for a map of a different setting? Just curious.</div> </div> </div> </div>Probably, as long as the setting has super sexy bear, I would prefer if it's a gay bear, but even Exalted don't have them so straight bears would be fine \u256e(\u2500\u25bd\u2500)\u256d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LeTip